{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/extras/35fe4168be4a1dd0d8053e26ae576598.avif?t=1768454993\" width=900 height=150 /></span>Lean Simulator: Desperation is a fusion of the Clicker and Survival genres. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At a surface level this is a meme game but under that unfunny purple coating, you'll find this is a (relatively tame) horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are monsters after you. You need to click fast and be prepared to adapt to new situations to survive as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/extras/5468f93ef5112b1b73b36fd81dd8d0bd.avif?t=1768454993\" width=900 height=150 /></span>The Lean Monsters seek 1 thing: Lean. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's all, provide them Lean and they'll leave you alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To acquire Lean, simply provide fuel to the Lean Machean by spamming the button attached to it and you will start acquiring Lean over time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just make sure to keep the Lean Machean fueled and Stabilised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/extras/589a3774a7383164007429f9532da2b8.avif?t=1768454993\" width=900 height=150 /></span>Feeling thirsty? There's a Cuboid of Lean in the room with you that will never run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink from it whenever your vision starts blurring. Difficulty to focus is a sign of Dehydration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure not to drink too much though as Lean is highly addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/extras/5845720a0c7e5bcbcc3327b47dc9f88c.avif?t=1768454993\" width=900 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thankfully, you aren't doing this for free. The Lean Monsters will pay you in Bread for giving them Lean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use Bread to Upgrade your Lean Quality, or Output Quantity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use it to re-stabilise the Lean Machean in the event it destabilises too far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could also re-stabilise the Lean Machean manually by accessing a hatch next to it but it's recommended to save that for emergencies as you cannot defend yourself while performing Maintenance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/extras/3854e771f91701451835274afb298e34.avif?t=1768454993\" width=900 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PTSD is an acronym for Potential to Stack Dough, it represents how far you've come since the beginning of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you perform in a single run, the more PTSD you will earn to spend on making future runs easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is essential that you make full use of your PTSD, as you'll need to be prepared for whatever the next run might throw at you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2936620?t=1768454993","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768454993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/e886ea725eb2e334409452a5ceeb714c9d9dff6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768454993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/e886ea725eb2e334409452a5ceeb714c9d9dff6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768454993","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game revolves around unrealistic depictions of the Lean drug"},"demos":[{"appid":3216160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/extras/35fe4168be4a1dd0d8053e26ae576598.avif?t=1768454993\" width=900 height=150 /></span>Lean Simulator: Desperation is a fusion of the Clicker and Survival genres. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At a surface level this is a meme game but under that unfunny purple coating, you'll find this is a (relatively tame) horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are monsters after you. You need to click fast and be prepared to adapt to new situations to survive as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/extras/5468f93ef5112b1b73b36fd81dd8d0bd.avif?t=1768454993\" width=900 height=150 /></span>The Lean Monsters seek 1 thing: Lean. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's all, provide them Lean and they'll leave you alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To acquire Lean, simply provide fuel to the Lean Machean by spamming the button attached to it and you will start acquiring Lean over time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just make sure to keep the Lean Machean fueled and Stabilised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/extras/589a3774a7383164007429f9532da2b8.avif?t=1768454993\" width=900 height=150 /></span>Feeling thirsty? There's a Cuboid of Lean in the room with you that will never run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink from it whenever your vision starts blurring. Difficulty to focus is a sign of Dehydration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure not to drink too much though as Lean is highly addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/extras/5845720a0c7e5bcbcc3327b47dc9f88c.avif?t=1768454993\" width=900 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thankfully, you aren't doing this for free. The Lean Monsters will pay you in Bread for giving them Lean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use Bread to Upgrade your Lean Quality, or Output Quantity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use it to re-stabilise the Lean Machean in the event it destabilises too far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could also re-stabilise the Lean Machean manually by accessing a hatch next to it but it's recommended to save that for emergencies as you cannot defend yourself while performing Maintenance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/extras/3854e771f91701451835274afb298e34.avif?t=1768454993\" width=900 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PTSD is an acronym for Potential to Stack Dough, it represents how far you've come since the beginning of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you perform in a single run, the more PTSD you will earn to spend on making future runs easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is essential that you make full use of your PTSD, as you'll need to be prepared for whatever the next run might throw at you.</p>","developers":["ToastedPerfection"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936620/aa40995752b0c7060250e11ff82b0b8c8a281809/header.jpg?t=1768454993","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2936620/723283/7087183a2824321badaaf524f11d9488fe68ea7d/1750890427/dash_av1.mpd?t=1720430087","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2936620/723283/7087183a2824321badaaf524f11d9488fe68ea7d/1750890427/dash_h264.mpd?t=1720430087","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2936620/723283/7087183a2824321badaaf524f11d9488fe68ea7d/1750890427/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1720430087","id":257036363,"name":"Lean Simulator: Desperation","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257036363/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1720430087"}],"name":"Lean Simulator: Desperation","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Lean Simulator: Desperation - $2.99 USD","packageid":1045942,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":299}],"title":"Buy Lean Simulator: Desperation"}],"packages":[1045942],"pc_requirements":{